Z||000001||pherder||09-10-2001||05:11 PM||||Do a search for 440T4 or 4T60 transaxles.  <P>You will find the threads putting a 4 speed transaxle in place of the 3T40 (T125C).<P>I just got done with one.  The only problems I have yet are getting it to NOT slam into reverse and to figure out how to set the TV cable and the vacuum modulator so the trans will shift correctly.<P>Paul<P>------------------<BR>--<BR>Paul Herder<BR>88 Formula - Artero kit car doner and 350 TPI<BR>86 SE - 3.2 w/440T4 Transaxle<BR>95 GMC - 350 TBI - Factory "Custom"<BR>92 Mazda Protege - Stock<BR>55 Jones - First Edition WIFE- all mods, equipment,updates :D<BR>Sedgwick, KS 67135||||reg||3
